### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Unified Document Viewer — HTTP Request Examples
### Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension to send
### requests directly from the editor (click "Send Request" above each block).
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### ── 1. Root Health Check ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 2. Aggregated Documents — Valid VIN (full success) ─────────────────────
### Both Sales and Service systems respond → degraded: false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?vin=1HGCM82633A004352 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 3. Aggregated Documents — Valid VIN with no matching documents ─────────
### Both systems respond but return empty lists → documents: []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?vin=00000000000000000 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 4. Invalid VIN — Too short (expect 422 Unprocessable Entity) ──────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?vin=ABC HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 5. Invalid VIN — Too long (expect 422 Unprocessable Entity) ───────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?vin=1HGCM82633A004352XX HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 6. Missing VIN parameter (expect 422 Unprocessable Entity) ────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 7. Search History — All records ────────────────────────────────────────
### Returns all past VIN searches stored in the database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 8. Search History — Filter by VIN ──────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?vin=1HGCM82633A004352 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 9. Search History — With pagination ────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/history?limit=5&offset=0 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### ── 10. OpenAPI Spec (JSON) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
